{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>VersaKey 是一款適用於 iPhone 與 iPad 的可自訂鍵盤，讓日常輸入更順手。它把數字、標點與常用符號放在按鍵的滑動選項中，無需反覆切換鍵盤佈局；同時可調整按鍵、工具列、主題及輸入輔助。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合經常在流動裝置上打字、希望減少切換步驟並依個人習慣調整鍵盤的使用者。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-12.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂按鍵與滑動輸入</h2>\n<p>在 VersaKey 向下滑動按鍵即可輸入替代字元，數字、標點與常用符號不必切換版面；亦可自訂按鍵字元及長按選單。程式支援 QWERTY、AZERTY、Colemak、Dvorak 與 Workman 佈局，可重新對應按鍵、開關獨立數字列、調整工具列與主題，並提供自動校正、詞語完成、下一個詞預測及表情符號建議。Practice Lab 可練習輸入並追蹤進度，啟用個人化後可學習手指落點。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-16-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-17-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-18-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-19-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-20-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1177\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2622x1206bb-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：VersaKey: Custom iOS Keyboard</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/versakey-custom-ios-keyboard/id6796115889?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.435982+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":428,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T05:33:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:59:12.574591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:12.934364+00:00","content_hash":"0860d46a75d7666c90bdcac7dd4e28133043d426f9585bfe5880da55359d5b34","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}